		"description": "<p><em>Gadget — A sticky firearm round that mires an area.</em></p><p><strong>2 Actions · Requires Firearm.</strong> Range 6, Blast 3. The area becomes Slowed Terrain for 1 minute or until dispersed. Creatures that start or end their turn in the area must make a STR save or be Restrained.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Targets that leave the area are still Slowed, 2 turns.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> You have advantage on Grapple (STR) saves.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Grants the Glue Shell gadget item (activation, 1 scrap) and the \"Glue Shell (Toolbelt)\" feature (upgrade, 2 scraps); both spend from your Toolbelt pool — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Passive: Offers advantage on Grapple (STR) saves (tick it in the save dialog).</em></p>",
